        the build project's build output artifacts.
    environment : CodebuildAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1ProjectSpecInitProviderEnvironment, default is Undefined, optional
        environment
    fileSystemLocations : [CodebuildAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1ProjectSpecInitProviderFileSystemLocationsItems0], default is Undefined, optional
        A set of file system locations to mount inside the build. File system locations
        are documented below.
    logsConfig : CodebuildAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1ProjectSpecInitProviderLogsConfig, default is Undefined, optional
        logs config
    projectVisibility : str, default is Undefined, optional
        Specifies the visibility of the project's builds. Possible values are: PUBLIC_READ
        and PRIVATE. Default value is PRIVATE.
    queuedTimeout : float, default is Undefined, optional
        Number of minutes, from 5 to 480 (8 hours), a build is allowed to be queued before it
